# kind: 3-to-8-decoder
# generator: LogicalOptimizer.Benchmarks PlaCorpusGenerator (deterministic)
# regenerate: dotnet run -c Release --project LogicalOptimizer.Benchmarks -- generate-corpora
# note: one-hot line decoder: y_i = minterm i of (s2 s1 s0)
.i 3
.o 8
.ilb s2 s1 s0
.ob y0 y1 y2 y3 y4 y5 y6 y7
.p 8
000 10000000
001 01000000
010 00100000
011 00010000
100 00001000
101 00000100
110 00000010
111 00000001
.e
